marked-ring-assumptions := claim; frame M; status conditional; inputs {}; hash 75E786C179D795D181384DFC53FFEEF6; sources {}; statement On eight spin-half points let W be the global SU(2) singlet and U a unitary candidate. Each of the seven adjacent pair singlet projectors is transported to the next pair on both its Yes and No subspaces in W.
